{"answer_metrics":{"completion_tokens":2909,"format_repairs":0,"model_calls":1,"prompt_tokens":2910,"provider_request_attempts":1,"total_tokens":5819},"answer_result":{"answer":"Calvin planned to visit Boston after finishing the Frank Ocean tour; he wanted to explore the city, try delicious food, visit popular attractions, and take walks in Boston parks. Dave offered to show him around Boston and take him to his favorite food spots, and they planned to meet up for a meal/catch up when Calvin was in Boston. Calvin said he would let Dave know when he was in Boston/arrived and when he was free; Dave asked Calvin to fill him in on details and said he would be there to cheer Calvin on at his Boston show. Dave also offered to show Calvin his garage and cool cars, which Calvin accepted. Later, Dave said he might catch one of Calvin's Boston shows and asked Calvin to let him know when he was free to catch up.","answer_id":"answer-2a534f2b184398b44483e6aba8c9a66e943984c225e93c9aa2ef7e955558d15e","citations":["ev-5f081429214a0526826794a71492bdf487c5ab9aae78bd022540b4240bdbf907","ev-47b55e94102c37f381a63b21ab0d71675667357d60a984f8ca4b1dad3d1a47e3","ev-aea08079ce7e8f0f3eb4a3f9730a414d9aee8156ef8931892f295559f679a381","ev-4f115f75d250068906e013dc9b4c268ad88720c76e993ae9ee762743d8989a2d"],"evidence_bundle_id":"bundle-e3014f99ade548888a86c77a697f0849040c40f33d74961c0796a97d633e0b4d","evidence_input_sha256":"19869ae87d9129c4b48b6feef148a49a2908ef3729cab3d5c9bdda0074252058","format_repairs":0,"insufficient_evidence":false,"model_calls":1,"prompt_id":"project-defined-shared-evidence-answerer-v1","prompt_sha256":"6ee299d5a5095aaaac19c0a7b61321af3b1c87e7f6aec818f47749097b87a572","protocol_version":"shared-evidence-answerer-v1","provider_request_attempts":1,"question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What plans do Calvin and Dave have for when Calvin visits Boston?","question_id":"conv-50-q111","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-extension20-v2","run_position":11,"schema_version":1